{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"It would require a system to support it and I am willing to write up something to model it but what if players could have a \"lair.\"\n\nWhat if we gave them the ability to level up their lair similarly to how they level up themselves? This could be used creatively in story and allow for different levels of game play. I also see this as a possible way to syphon off additional wealth acquired through play...\n\nIf we are having vehicles this lair may be portable for some so that is another consideration. Asking here before I put the work into writing something up...","created_at":"2020-08-29T04:57:08.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"749130495098617937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
